    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya wilahīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūbawīla a batongeeji ba Baisilaeli, Ū SEEBA wafunije shilagīlo alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū munhū ūfunya shilahīlo shose shose kūlī SEEBA, nūūlū witunga wei ng'wenekīlī mu mhayo nebe, atizūgalūcha maganiko, alīyo shing'wigeleelilwe kwīshikīlīja pyī īyo walahīla kwīyīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhya ūfunya shilahīlo kūlī SEEBA, nūūlū witunga wei ng'wenekīlī mu mhayo nebe, alīyo ūbiza ataalī ha ng'wawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ū ise ūng'wigwa, gwike ūleka kūng'wīla mhayo gose gose, ū būlahīji wakwe ūbo wabūfunije īkūng'wigeleelwa kūbūshikīlīja; nūūlū ī mihayo īyo witungile wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ise ūlū wīyigwa ī mihayo īyo walahīlaga nūūlū witungaga wei ng'wenekīlī muyo, hūna ūnemeja, ītūbiza na nguzu; ū SEEBA akūntaligūla nguno ū ise wang'hamaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūtoolwa alīyo amalile kūfunya shilahīlo, nūūlū amalile kūhaya mhayo gose gose gwa kūntunga aho atamanile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi ū ngoshi ūlū wīyigwa ī yenīyo alīyo ūhuumūla dūhū, ūleka kūhaya nūūlū mhayo gose gose; a henaho akwigeleelwa kūshishikīlīja ī shilahīlo shakwe, nūūlū ī mihayo īyo yītungile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngoshi ūlū wigwa hūna ūnemeja, ī shilahīlo shenīsho nūūlū ū mhayo ūyo witunga gwenūyo gūkūbiza gwamalagwa ī nguzu. Ū SEEBA akūntaligūla ū mu shilahīlo shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūyo atī na ngoshi kūlwa kūchīlwa, nūūlū kūlwa kūbūlaga numba, ūlū ūfunya shilahīlo shose shose, nūūlū mhayo gwa kūntunga, ī yenīyo īkūntunga wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nkīma ūyo atoolilwe ūlū ūfunya shilahīlo, nūūlū ūhaya mhayo gose gose gwa kūntunga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ū ngoshi wīyigwa īyo walahīlile nūūlū īyo witungile yenīyo, alīyo ūneka gīko dūhū yaya nūūlū kūng'wīla mhayo gwa kūng'hūgūla, nūūlū gwa kūnemeja, a henaho ī shilahīlo nūūlū ī mihayo īyo witungile īkwigeleelwa kūshikīlījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngoshi ūlū wīyigwa ī mihayo yenīyo hūna wīlema nūūlū ūng'hūgūla, a henaho shilahīlo shose shose īsho shafuma ū mu nomo gwakwe shitūbiza na ngunzu, nguno ū ngoshi wang'hūgūlaga, na lūūlū ū SEEBA akūntaligūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūyo atoolilwe ūlū ūlahīla, nūūlū ūhaya mihayo ya kūntunga, ū ngoshi adūgije kwīyinha nguzu ī mihayo yenīyo nūūlū adūgije kwībūlaga yūgaya ī nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū ngoshi ūlū wīyigwa ī mihayo yenīyo alīyo wikala ahuumūlile dūhū shikū jose, a henaho akūbiza aloolecha gīkī ī shilahīlo shakwe nī mihayo īyo yīntungile ni yongejage ū kūntunga. Ūlū wīyigwa ī mihayo yenīyo alīyo ūhuumūla dūhū, akūbiza alizunīlīja nayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū nose ūūkahaya mhayo kū kale, hū kūhaya akūbiza wa kūsayīlwa ūlū ūbiza wingīlile mu būhūbi ū nke wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo shenīshi ū SEEBA akanagīīla ū Musa nguno ya koolecha ī mihayo īyo īng'wigeleelilwe munhū kwīmana kūlwa nke wakwe; nūūlū myaji kūlwa nshīke wakwe ūyo alī ha kaya, atatoolilwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
